  flavorText: 'Soldiers train 20% faster (existing, port as-is from CivilizationProfile.TrainTimeMultiplier)

    Walls/Gates/Towers
    cost 20% less Stone (structural - lets Vijayanagara wall up earlier/cheaper than
    anyone else, reflecting Hampi''s real fortification obsession)

    Towers get
    +1 attack range (Hampi''s watchtowers saw further)

    Team bonus: Allied Walls/Gates/Towers
    get +15% HP (diluted version of Hampi Fortifications)

